spell.contenttweaker:summon_voideye.desc=Conjures a Void Eye to fight for you.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_ghost=Summon Ghost
spell.contenttweaker:summon_ghost.desc=Conjures a Ghost to fight for you.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_nekros=Summon Nekros
spell.contenttweaker:summon_nekros.desc=Conjures a Nekros to fight for you. The Nekros can summon undead mobs.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_damcell=Summon Damcell
spell.contenttweaker:summon_damcell.desc=Conjures a Damcell that can damage nearby enemies with the chance of trapping and killing them.  
spell.contenttweaker:dreadlich_skull=Dread Lich Skull
spell.contenttweaker:dreadlich_skull.desc=Shoots a homing dread lich skull to a target enemy. If not target is present, it will hit the caster instead.
spell.contenttweaker:ender_burst=Ender Burst
spell.contenttweaker:ender_burst.desc=Shoots an explosive ender eye that passes through enemies but explodes upon hitting blocks.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_frostwalker=Summon Frostwalker
spell.contenttweaker:summon_frostwalker.desc=Conjures a Frostwalker to fight for you. Frostwalkers can conjure a line of ice that damages enemies.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_boulderer=Summon Boulderer
spell.contenttweaker:summon_boulderer.desc=Conjures a Boulderer to fight for you. Boulderers dig and climb towards their targets.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_undeadcrew=Summon Undead Crew
spell.contenttweaker:summon_undeadcrew.desc=Conjures an undead pirate crew to fight for you.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_vespa=Summon Vespa
spell.contenttweaker:summon_vespa.desc=Conjures a Vespa to fight for you. The vespa disappears after 45 seconds.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_aetherwinds=Summon Aether Winds
spell.contenttweaker:summon_aetherwinds.desc=Conjures whirlwinds around you that pulls enemies in and tosses them around.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_swetarmy=Summon Swet Army
spell.contenttweaker:summon_swetarmy.desc=Conjures swets that fights for you. The swets can impede the movement of their targets.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_carminitegolem=Summon Carminite Golem
spell.contenttweaker:summon_carminitegolem.desc=Conjures a Carminite Golem to fight for you.
spell.contenttweaker:summon_remnantswarm=Summon Remnant Swarm
spell.contenttweaker:summon_remnantswarm.desc=Conjures multiple remnants to fight for you.